*.sqlite3.bak
secrets/

evaluation/reports/*
!evaluation/reports/m3-synthetic-example.json
!evaluation/reports/m4-synthetic-example.json
!evaluation/reports/cognitive-turn-synthetic-example.json
!evaluation/reports/feeling-synthetic-example.json
!evaluation/reports/cognitive-alpha-adversarial-report.json
!evaluation/reports/real-provider-conversation-report*.json
!evaluation/reports/context-memory-real-report*.json
# Phase 2.2 real-model runs are evidence too: the file name carries the run id
# and the writer refuses to overwrite, so tracking them cannot clobber a run.
!evaluation/reports/context-memory-v2-real-report*.json
# Human reviews are evidence, and evidence is tracked. Nothing ignores this
# directory today; the rule states the intent so a later broad ignore of
# evaluation/ cannot make a reviewer's record disappear silently.
!evaluation/reviews/
